# Build context is the repo root (compose: context: .), but the gateway image
# only needs agent-gateway/ + proto/. Exclude everything else to keep the
# context small, and exclude host-generated stubs so the in-image gen wins.
*
!agent-gateway/
!proto/
agent-gateway/node_modules
agent-gateway/gen
agent-gateway/.svid
**/__pycache__
*.log
